                <div style="color: #475569; margin-top: 3px;">Terminal Output: <code>&gt; File written: server.log • File content verified: "Backend Online 2026"</code></div>
            </div>
            <p class="mission-subtitle">Follow the step-by-step instructions below in the editor:</p>
            <div id="taskChecklist"></div>
        </article>
        
        <!-- Core Concept & Analogy -->
        <article class="concept-card">
            <h3><span>💡</span> Core Concept &amp; Mental Model</h3>
            <div class="analogy-callout">
                <strong>Real-World Analogy:</strong> The <code>with open(...)</code> block is like opening a notebook 📓, jotting down your notes, and automatically closing the cover so pages never get lost.
            </div>
        </article>

        
        <article class="concept-card">
            <h3><span>📁</span> Context Manager File I/O</h3>
